It is not ghosts visiting us from the past, why TIs need to compare notes

> Yesterday a real TI said I lied about what app the Specterati use on TIs. Same time other TIs have confirmed they have seen the same app.  Exact reason TIs should not isolate. It is like how when people first saw photogr&hellip;

Yesterday a real TI said I lied about what app the Specterati use on TIs. Same time other TIs have confirmed they have seen the same app. Exact reason TIs should not isolate. It is like how when people first saw photographs and thought it was ghosts of dead people visiting them. They were not idiots they just saw something or learned something for the first time and need to learn what was happening. But the Specterati will take advantage of this. Dear fellow TIs none of you are idiots. Otherwise you would not be a TI and Jack “Porsey”  would not be publishing my personal emails and private files as his white papers and being applauded for the work. Let us compare notes and collaborate. We already know what happens when we do not. Let us try an alternative. And to any TI that joins my spaces, please remember that we can disagree respectfully. And disagreeing with me at any point does not mean you are not welcome here. Lastly, the Specterati use multiple apps. The one I saw is a knock off Whatsapp with one way communication. I wrote posts about this already. Where the street stalker receives messages from a “handler” but the street stalker cannot respond. Likely for plausible deniability. “No” hard evidence the two people are connected. That your friendly “Christian” neighbor is collaborating with a gang in a human trafficking ring. Another app Matthew Cappadocia (aka The Wizard of Oz) got pictures of. Go to the post, the picture says it all. And likely explains how they can mimic a TI in real time. Why multiple apps? Likely a combination, there is a hierarchy, easy to manipulate street stalkers. For example, the fake Christian thinks they are just doing high school pranks and not a human trafficker. For example, Jessica: https://www.quora.com/What-is-gang-stalking/answer/Jessica-White-823 Also to have separation of duties if one gets caught. Like how drug dealers get children to distribute the drugs but not handle the money. Also technical reasons like bloating an app with features has consequences. The list goes on. For the love of humanity. Let us compare notes. It is not ghosts haunting us. It is narcs with too much money. On Quora: https://tiskillsnetwork.quora.com/Yesterday-a-real-TI-said-I-lied-about-what-app-the-Specterati-use-on-TIs-Same-time-other-TIs-have-confirmed-they-have-s

