Let's pick up where Matthew left off

> Where there is a will, there is a way.  One of the most helpful TIs on Quora (https://www.quora.com/profile/Matthew-Cappadocia-aka-The-Wizard-of-Oz) mentioned that Quora will not allow him to collect/post survey data. An&hellip;

Where there is a will, there is a way. One of the most helpful TIs on Quora (https://www.quora.com/profile/Matthew-Cappadocia-aka-The-Wizard-of-Oz) mentioned that Quora will not allow him to collect/post survey data. And they ban him every 14 days. Once one 14-day ban finishes, another begins. This limits his reach by limiting new posts and responding to comments. Who says we have to use Quora? Matthew asked each person to respond to a specific thread, answering survey questions and then manually entered the data into Google Maps. I prefer automation. If each TI has 2 minutes, we can collect the data we need. Here is what I suggest.   Create an account at app.chargingthefuture.com. DM for an invite code   Go to “SupportMatch” on the left-hand side and complete the optional profile.   With profiles completed, I can generate and release research data on TIs. Keeping in mind, I will respect everyone’s privacy. You would need to opt into being included in any released research. image1906×855 78.1 KB Reference: https://rnudvbhbuspdwbhs.quora.com/https-targetedindividualssurvey-quora-com-Targeted-Individuals-Survey-final-post-Quora-will-not-allow-me-to-ask-people?ch=10&amp;oid=235035929&amp;share=2f9ea23e&amp;srid=3UT8yW&amp;target_type=post

Live, Work & Prevail | Our Mission, Commitment and Purpose

> Mission Statement for Charging the Future At Charging the Future, we strive to empower individuals to Live, Work, &amp; Conquer in a world where clarity, critical thinking, and authenticity guide every decision. As pioneers &hellip;

Mission Statement for Charging the Future At Charging the Future, we strive to empower individuals to Live, Work, &amp; Conquer in a world where clarity, critical thinking, and authenticity guide every decision. As pioneers of the world’s first TI economy, we focus on offering psyop-free products and services that foster a safe and thriving community. Our Commitment We are dedicated to supporting one another as we navigate the complexities of life. Together, we commit to choices that align with our core values and aspirations, ensuring that everyone has the opportunity to live without fear. Our Purpose Founded with a vision to prevent the tragic consequences of human trafficking, we seek to create an economy that not only uplifts those who have been affected but also empowers every individual to reclaim their power. By building a sustainable and ethical marketplace, we aim to pave the way for a brighter future where every person can thrive.

