> My response to a comment on Quora. Quora does not allow linking to comments which is bizarre and annoying. Making Discourse another reason it is better.  Quora post: https://targetedindividualsgrouptig.quora.com/Lets-see&hellip;

My response to a comment on Quora. Quora does not allow linking to comments which is bizarre and annoying. Making Discourse another reason it is better. Quora post: https://targetedindividualsgrouptig.quora.com/Lets-see-this-happen Quora comment on the above post from: https://www.quora.com/profile/EB-814.  Have ever offered someone money to take you off “the list”. A few years ago When I was still quite nieve I noticed a guy following me everywhere in Virginia city and I asked him how he was able to track me and he said he did it through an app called discord. Its like a gaming app or something. Can any of you tell me something about if you’ve heard of that happening? Ive also heard they use a program called Pokémon go. Anyways at one point I asked him how much money I could give him to get me off the list. And he said: “If you want to get off the list then go on the app”. At that point I tried to walk to my motel room and (i had been drinking) I fell hard on the ground on my hip and almost rolled down one of the streets (They have huge hills like san Francisco roads). I think of that as a blessing now because I was gonna go over and talk to him more. But when I sobered up the next day I realized that what he was really saying was “if you cant beat us join us” ya know Anyways the hotel was claimed to be haunted. Everyone in town believed it was haunted. There was some wierd shit happening there but id call it more like street theater stuff like abandoned dogs roaming the hallways and loud thumps from the room upstairs. But I get that everywhere especially motel 6. I dont want to get into the supernatural because you dont have To prove gangstaking. And ive never seen a ghost. But I do think its interesting that these ghost busters are looking for high EMF readings Using meters that a targeted individual would use to detect high EMF’s. Not fishing for a correlation just saying Maybe these EMF’s make people see ghosts. Or visa versa Anyways since gangstalking is all just a big ass spook show anyways Anyone wanna chime in on this? Be gentle im sensitive  My response: I am not sure your age, otherwise I would try to pick something from when you grew up. Pokemon Go however hit a high popularity in what 2014/2015/2016? I do not feel like googling that right now. If that is the case maybe you know of where is waldo? The gstalker was messing with you. Pokemon go is just a game has nothing to do with how they are stalking you. At the same time he was being a smart ass. Pokemon go gameplay involves people going to specific locations to “catch” something. In our case gstalkers are given our location and they opt into following us and showing up where we are to harass us. As show here: https://www.quora.com/What-is-gang-stalking/answer/Jessica-White-823 Discord is a chat app. Not the same but think of facebook messenger or a better version of AIM. Anyone offering to take money to get you off the list is a scam. I have seen one of the apps they use. They do not use apps you have access to/commercially available apps. Matthew Cappadocia (aka The Wizard of Oz) saw another one of their tracking apps as well. He showed a screenshot. Everything they say and do is a lie or manipulation. Keep engaging on Quora to learn more. I also have a space called TI Skills Network. Join if you would rather live, work and commute with other TIs. We are a global support group made of only TIs. Quora post: https://tiskillsnetwork.quora.com/Our-only-option-is-to-opt-out-of-their-reindeer-games-My-response-to-a-TI-saying-he-was-told-he-can-pay-to-be-removed
